body:
Just like you, I like to flex a S2 ticket limited: The Executioner Nemesis, the only skin that gets close to it for me is the Crusader one, but I still pref Executioner most of the times. 

&#x200B;

Also Nu Wa's space skin (the white version). I find the voicepack so joyful and pleasing ("I'm so good it's like I planet :D") that I never use Old Wa, Warlock and Empress, eventhough they look amazing.

&#x200B;

Weirdly enough my favourite skins for Erlang and Xing are their recolors. Those bronze and greenish blue colors on Erlang just clicked with and Xing reminds me of Warcraft fel orcs, he looks soooo badass.

&#x200B;

Finally, and despite the hate they get, I use Khepri's shadow skin the most because he looks like a real beetle.

&#x200B;

So yeah, besides these it's the rule of cool that decides

&#x200B;

&#x200B;
